WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.810
Your week, your team's launch, one big piece of work: you plan them all.

00:00:05.560 --> 00:00:06.230
Where do they live?

00:00:06.920 --> 00:00:12.470
It's often in a chat, written once, while the work keeps moving in monday boards, Slack and email.

00:00:12.860 --> 00:00:15.810
That's like a printed map: perfect on day one,

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:18.570
then quietly wrong as the roads change.

00:00:19.140 --> 00:00:22.250
But a navigation app updates as the roads change.

00:00:22.640 --> 00:00:28.970
So give your plan a home you check daily, like a to-do list in a Claude artifact or your team's monday board.

00:00:29.580 --> 00:00:33.530
Then a skill and an automation keep it fresh from where the work happens.

00:00:34.160 --> 00:00:36.950
And that can be one of the biggest day-to-day unlocks.

00:00:37.700 --> 00:00:43.470
So in this adventure, you first decide what kind of plan, who it's for, and how you like to plan.

00:00:43.840 --> 00:00:45.970
Then you build it from what's on your plate,

00:00:46.160 --> 00:00:48.390
and keep it true after week one.
